title: 주3_수_1교시_강의실_양나현_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
NaHyun: Hey, {name()}.
{name()}: Hey.
<<show hyun_spec>>
NaHyun: (Yawns)
NaHyun: I should've grabbed a coffee on my way here.
{name()}: Do you drink coffee often?
NaHyun: Yeah. I literally can't survive without it...
NaHyun: (Checks the time) Still got a few minutes before class starts.
<<choice 주3_수_1교시_강의실_양나현_긍1_영문 "Go with her." 주3_수_1교시_강의실_양나현_부1_영문 "Stay in the classroom.">>
NaHyun: Want to run to the convenience store with me?
===

title: 주3_수_1교시_강의실_양나현_긍1_영문
---
<<show hyun_spec>>
{name()}: Sure, let's go.
<<choice 주3_수_1교시_강의실_양나현_긍2_영문 "Of course I'll buy it for you!" 주3_수_1교시_강의실_양나현_부2_영문 "Why on earth should I buy you coffee?" >>
NaHyun: (Playfully) Buy me a coffee?
===

title: 주3_수_1교시_강의실_양나현_부1_영문
---
<<dislike 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun -5>>
{name()}: I'm good.
NaHyun: Really? I'll just go by myself then.
<<play 공통_의자>>
(NaHyun stands up and leaves the classroom.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주3_수_1교시_강의실_양나현_긍2_영문
---
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +10>>
{name()}: I'll get it for you.
<<show hyun_smile>>
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
NaHyun: Wait, really? You don't have to.
{name()}: No, it's on me today.
(We went to the convenience store together, and I bought her a coffee.)
NaHyun: Thanks.
<<end>>
===

title: 주3_수_1교시_강의실_양나현_부2_영문
---
<<dislike 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun -5>>
{name()}: No way.
<<choice 주3_수_1교시_강의실_양나현_긍2_영문 "I'm just kidding, I'll buy it." 주3_수_1교시_강의실_양나현_부2_영문 "I'm not buying it." >>
<<show hyun_neg>>
NaHyun: For real?
===